---
title: Masterclasses
---
notes:

The first masterclasses are online, more will follow. Full-day classes run 9:00–16:00 with a one-hour lunch break at 12:00; half-day classes run 9:00–12:00 or 13:00–16:00.
You can switch classes until 2 April, see the [FAQ](/faqs/#switch-masterclass). Cancellations and refunds follow the [masterclass terms](/terms/) (German).
